<node name="Exam" unique_id="540" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="1" foreground="#af65f4" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h1" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Your workspace for exam days: targets, credentials, findings, flags and a log for each day. Every table here matches a part of the </rich_text>
<rich_text link="webs https://docs.sysreptor.com/assets/reports/HTB-CPTS-Report.pdf" foreground="#af65f4">official CPTS report template</rich_text>
<rich_text>, so by the end most of the report is already written down.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#e03131">Keep this file private
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Once you start the exam, this file holds exam content. Don't push it to a public GitHub repo or share it, during or after the exam. HTB's terms don't allow it. To lock it with a password, use </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">File › Save As</rich_text>
<rich_text> and pick a </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Password Protected</rich_text>
<rich_text> storage type (</rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#af65f4">.ctx</rich_text>
<rich_text> or </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#af65f4">.ctz</rich_text>
<rich_text>).</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Start here</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>1. </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 541" foreground="#af65f4">01 - Before You Start</rich_text>
<rich_text>: go through the checklist before you start.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>2. </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 542" foreground="#af65f4">02 - Scope &amp; Rules</rich_text>
<rich_text>: copy the scope from the letter of engagement.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>3. Keep a log as you work: </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Log</rich_text>
<rich_text> has one node per exam day, from </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 552" foreground="#af65f4">Day 01</rich_text>
<rich_text> to </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 561" foreground="#af65f4">Day 10</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Targets</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>One node per item under </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Targets</rich_text>
<rich_text>. Start with </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 550" foreground="#af65f4">Target 1</rich_text>
<rich_text> and rename it. For each new one, duplicate </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Templates › Target</rich_text>
<rich_text> (</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Tree › Duplicate Node</rich_text>
<rich_text>) and drag the copy under </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Targets</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Tracking</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 543" foreground="#af65f4">03 - Network Map</rich_text>
<rich_text>: how the networks connect, and your tunnels.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 544" foreground="#af65f4">04 - Credentials</rich_text>
<rich_text>: every user and secret you find. Report: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Compromised Users</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 545" foreground="#af65f4">05 - Findings</rich_text>
<rich_text>: every vulnerability worth reporting. Report: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Summary of Findings</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 546" foreground="#af65f4">06 - Attack Chain</rich_text>
<rich_text>: the path through the network, step by step.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 547" foreground="#af65f4">07 - Flags</rich_text>
<rich_text>: every flag and where it came from. Report: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Flags Discovered</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 548" foreground="#af65f4">08 - Cleanup</rich_text>
<rich_text>: everything you changed on a host. Report: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Changes/Host Cleanup</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#af65f4">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<encoded_png char_offset="0" justification="left" link=""></encoded_png>
<node name="01 - Before You Start" unique_id="541" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cpts exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Setup</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>VPN connects and you can reach the first target</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Screenshot tool ready (Flameshot or similar). Paste each screenshot straight into the host's node with </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#af65f4">Ctrl+V</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Screenshot names picked, like </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#af65f4">web01-03-shell.png</rich_text>
<rich_text> (item, step, what it shows), so you can find each one when you write the report</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Terminal logging on (</rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#af65f4">tmux</rich_text>
<rich_text> logging or </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#af65f4">script</rich_text>
<rich_text>) so you keep every command and its output</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Report started from the HTB CPTS template in SysReptor</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Autosave and backups on: </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">File › Preferences › Miscellaneous</rich_text>
<rich_text>, tick </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Autosave Every x Minutes</rich_text>
<rich_text> and </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Create a Backup Copy Before Saving</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>A copy of this file kept somewhere private. Only open it in one CherryTree window at a time, or you can lose changes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Read</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Letter of engagement read twice, scope copied into </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 542" foreground="#af65f4">02 - Scope &amp; Rules</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Exam start time, end time and report deadline written down</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>What counts as a flag and how to submit it</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Plan</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Rough plan for each day, with real breaks</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Sleep plan. Long exams are lost to fatigue more often than to missing skills.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Wordlists and tools ready on your attack box</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 540" foreground="#af65f4">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#af65f4">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
</node>
<node name="02 - Scope &amp; Rules" unique_id="542" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cpts exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">In Scope Assets</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">copy these from the letter of engagement; the report has the same table</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Out of Scope</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. A host the letter says not to touch</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Rules of Engagement</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. No denial of service</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#af65f4">Timeline</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 540" foreground="#af65f4">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
